    "public_preview": null,
    "text": "Leave a 💚 below to affirm! To those trying to move forward without losing yourself in the process, may you remember that healing is not the destination. Living is.\n\nAt some point, the goal has to stop being about analyzing every wound, revisiting every chapter, or trying to make sense of every ending. The goal has to become returning to yourself, to your life. Returning to your joy. Returning to your creativity. Returning to the people and experiences that make you feel alive.\n\nIt’s okay to let go. You deserve a life that is bigger than your pain. 🫶🏽\n\nWritten by: @williegreene_",
    "word_count": 101
  },
